flowchart TD
  T[User question] --> N[Speech/domain normalisation]
  N --> R{Farm fact, calculation, device state, action, or graph?}
  R -->|yes| D[MariaDB + approved deterministic operation]
  D --> F[Exact result or honest unavailable state]
  R -->|no / explanation needed| H[Choose best relevant evidence]
  H --> T1[1 FarmPi data, DairyNZ, relevant NZ government]
  H --> T2[2 Trusted primary organisation/manufacturer]
  H --> T3[3 Reputable general]
  H --> T4[4 General/unverified web]
  H --> T5[5 Model knowledge]
  F --> P[Source tier, category, provenance, uncertainty]
  T1 --> P
  T2 --> P
  T3 --> P
  T4 --> P
  T5 --> P
  P --> C{Request satisfied?}
  C -->|yes| U[Useful response + evidence/chart]
  C -->|no| A[Inspect related application capabilities]
  A -->|alternative exists| U
  A -->|none| Z[Concise limitation + available options]
